WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,850
What clothes were washed?

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,370
Wash it clean next time

3
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:05,370
Did you hear that?

4
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:12,750
Otherwise I'll kick you out

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:14,910
Go to the next place to find supplies

6
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:18,740
Two bottles of good wine were wasted

7
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:19,740
There are people in every house

8
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:20,740
Also checking cars everywhere

9
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:33,870
And there are trucks?

10
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:36,580
A gift from Director Bai and Grandma Bai’s family

11
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,580
And a jar of lollipops

12
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,580
The little lady is keeping it for you.

13
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,580
The little lady is the best

14
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:45,580
I knew it would be best for you and me to come less often

15
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:47,580
You can't eat too much sugar either.

16
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,580
Beware of toothache

17
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,580
It’s hard to find a dentist now

18
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,610
No problem

19
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,020
Li Dajun and others

20
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:59,020
You won't keep an eye on us, right?

21
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:01,020
Both of those two people don't look right.

22
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,210
possible

23
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:05,070
Pay more attention in the past few days

24
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:06,070
Pay special attention to them

25
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:08,900
Don't worry, boss
